  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないの　どくぶくろに　ためた\nどくそを　ひふから　ぶんぴつ。\nさわると　ピリピリと　しびれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내의 독주머니에 저장하고 있는\n독소를 피부를 통해 분비한다.\n건드리면 찌릿하고 마비된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從皮膚把體內的毒囊裡\n儲存著的毒素分泌出來。\n一旦觸碰牠就會感到麻麻的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa peau sécrète les toxines accumulées\ndans sa poche de poison interne.\nQuand on le touche, on se fait électrocuter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Das Gift aus dem Giftsack in seinem Körper\nsondert es über die Haut ab. Berührt man es,\nbekommt man einen lähmenden Schock verpasst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secreta toxinas por la piel y las almacena\nen una bolsa de veneno interna. Tocarlo da\ncalambre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secerne dalla pelle le tossine contenute nella\nsua sacca di veleno interna. Provoca a chi lo\ntocca una sensazione di bruciore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stores poison in an internal poison sac and\nsecretes that poison through its skin. If you touch\nthis Pokémon, a tingling sensation follows.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内の　毒袋に　溜めた\n毒素を　皮膚から　分泌。\n触ると　ピリピリと　痺れる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会从皮肤把体内的毒囊里\n储存着的毒素分泌出来。\n一旦触碰它就会感到麻麻的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secreta toxinas por la piel y las almacena\nen una bolsa de veneno interna. Tocarlo da\ncalambre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくそを　かがくへんか　させて\nでんきを　だす。　でんりょくは\nよわいが　ビリビリと　しびれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독소를 화학 변화시켜\n전기를 만들어 낸다. 전력은\n약하지만 찌릿찌릿 마비된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "透過讓自身的毒素產生\n化學反應來發電。電力\n雖然弱，卻能造成麻痺。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Par un procédé chimique, il change son poison\nen électricité. L’intensité du courant est faible,\nmais peut engourdir un ennemi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ändert sein Toxin auf chemischer Ebene,\num Strom zu erzeugen. Dieser ist zwar schwach,\nkann aber einen lähmenden Schlag verursachen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Provoca una reacción química para generar\nenergía eléctrica con sus toxinas. Aunque de\nbajo voltaje, puede causar entumecimiento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce elettricità grazie a una reazione chimica\ndelle sue tossine. Il voltaggio è debole, ma può\nintorpidire il nemico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison\nto produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it\ncan cause a tingling paralysis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒素を　化学変化　させて\n電気を　出す。　電力は\n弱いが　ビリビリと　痺れる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过让自身的毒素产生\n化学反应来发电。电力\n虽然弱，却能造成麻痹。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Provoca una reacción química para generar\nenergía eléctrica con sus toxinas. Aunque de\nbajo voltaje, puede causar entumecimiento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "よごれた　みずを　のんでも　へいき。たいないの　きかんで　じぶんにはむがいの　どくえきに　ろかするぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오염된 물을 마셔도 끄떡없다. 체내의 기관에서 자신에게는 무해한 독액으로 걸러 내기 때문이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "就算喝下污水也能安然無恙。那是因為牠會靠著體內的器官把污水過濾成對自己無害的毒液。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut boire de l’eau sale sans aucun problème grâce à son organe filtrant, qui transforme les liquides en un poison sans danger pour lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann problemlos Schmutzwasser trinken. Ein Organ in seinem Körper filtert dieses zu einer giftigen Flüssigkeit, die ihm nichts anhaben kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede beber aguas emponzoñadas sin problema. Las filtra mediante un órgano interno para crear un veneno al que él mismo es inmune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dotato di un organo in grado di filtrare anche l’acqua più sporca, può berla e convertirla in un liquido tossico a lui innocuo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has no problem drinking dirty water. An organ inside Toxel’s body filters such water into a poisonous liquid that is harmless to Toxel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "汚れた　水を　飲んでも　平気。体内の　器官で　自分には無害の　毒液に　ろ過するぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喝了污水也安然无恙。那是因为它能靠着体内的器官把污水过滤成对自己无害的毒液。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede beber aguas emponzoñadas sin problema. Las filtra mediante un órgano interno para crear un veneno al que él mismo es inmune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わがままで　とても　あまえんぼう。たいないの　２つの　ふくろにどくと　でんきを　それぞれ　ためる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "제멋대로에 엄청난 응석꾸러기다. 체내에 있는 2개의 주머니에 독과 전기를 나눠서 비축하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "任性且非常愛撒嬌。體內的兩個囊袋分別儲存著毒和電。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon égoïste aime l’attention. Son corps contient deux poches qui lui permettent d’emmagasiner du poison et de l’électricité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses selbstsüchtige und verzogene Pokémon speichert Gift und Elektrizität in zwei separaten Säcken in seinem Körper.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es egoísta y caprichoso. Almacena veneno y electricidad en dos bolsas internas distintas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un Pokémon egoista che pensa solo a se stesso. Immagazzina veleno ed elettricità in due sacche distinte all’interno del suo corpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
